# The existing tts scenario asks Xardas once. Start rec before it speaks and
# leave enough quiet after the reply to include every npc_voice_end event.
seed 73013
cheat god
# The tower's nearby fire masks the fake tone in total RMS. Use the quiet,
# flat valley fixture shared with the aim/flinch benches, keeping effects on.
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
put NONE_100_XARDAS 100 0
watch NONE_100_XARDAS
cam face 80 0 1
rec tts
waitreply 120000 4000
stop
